    "If Dấu isn’t in that list, log out and log back in once (%@ › **%@**), then open Dấu again." : {
      "comment" : "First %@ = the Apple menu symbol, second %@ = macOS's Log Out item (D38).",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
