        }
      }
    },
    "While typing" : {
      "comment" : "Add-rule sheet: label of the underline choice.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While typing"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Khi đang gõ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word start: f → ph, j → gi (VNI also w → qu) · Word end: g → ng, h → nh, k → ch. Applied when you finish a word, only if the result is a valid Vietnamese word. Turning this on turns off Allow consonants z, f, w, j." : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle of Consonant shortcuts. “Allow consonants z, f, w, j” = the other advanced toggle (D22).",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Word start: f → ph, j → gi (VNI also w → qu) · Word end: g → ng, h → nh, k → ch. Applied when you finish a word, only if the result is a valid Vietnamese word. Turning this on turns off Allow consonants z, f, w, j."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Đầu từ: f → ph, j → gi (VNI thêm w → qu) · Cuối từ: g → ng, h → nh, k → ch. Áp dụng khi gõ xong từ, chỉ khi ra từ tiếng Việt hợp lệ. Bật mục này sẽ tắt Cho phép phụ âm z, f, w, j."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this anytime in Dấu Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding step 3 subtitle. “Dấu Settings” = the Settings window's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can change this anytime in Dấu Settings."
